  "story": {
    "day": 35,
    "title": "Kaya's Travel Dreams",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya and her sister planned a trip.",
      "It was a cool Saturday in October.",
      "They looked at pictures of Sydney, Australia.",
      "Kaya imagined a hot spring day there.",
      "She saw a brown dog with a yellow ball.",
      "His nose was wet, and his mouth was open.",
      "An old man walked by. He said, \"Pardon me, I need a map.\"",
      "Kaya wanted delicious Japanese food here.",
      "Her sister suggested a purple grape recipe.",
      "Then, they talked about London and New York.",
      "Everyone had a dream job: doctor or firefighter.",
      "An office worker used a telephone in Hong Kong."
    ]
  }
}